abstract: >-
  An autonomous valet parking system for a car-like Ackermann vehicle,
  combining utility-based parking-slot selection, Hybrid A* motion planning,
  Pure Pursuit and Stanley path tracking, PID speed control, localisation,
  and a reflexive swept-footprint time-to-collision safety layer. The system
  includes a Webots integration, headless simulation twin, reproducible
  experiments, and automated tests.

